==Battleground==
*1 [[E. Honda (Enemy)|E. Honda]] spawns as the boss after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Blanka (Enemy)|Blanka]] spawns after 63.33 seconds<sup>1,900f</sup>.
*10 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 5~15 seconds<sup>150f~450f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The main enemies of the stage don't come out too early, so you can quickly destroy the base with some [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]] in order to win.

